Scope to clarify when revisiting:

- Grid thumbnails vs detail hero vs both
- Own Profile vs other-user public wardrobe
- Per-item/outfit override vs global setting vs privacy/wardrobe visibility flags

## When revisiting

1. Decide default (hide vs show) and any user-facing control.
2. Apply consistently across Profile grids, `ReadOnlyItemDetailView`, `ReadOnlyOutfitDetailView`, and related engagement rows / RPCs if needed.
